You have to adapt this code to the ArrayList class you want to test. This example is just an illustration of what a unit test for the ArrayList class would look like. It uses the PexLib, a library for parameterized testing developed by Microsoft Research.

Please note that PexLib isn't open-source. And the provided code is written in C# and uses Pexlib which is specific to Microsoft's own PexLib.
This kind of testing provides a way to expose potential issues, and validate edge cases.

